abstract: "A selected public methods edition comprising research curation and preservation guidance, a catalogue schema, an offline metadata and byte-integrity validator, regression tests, three link-only public references and a fictional worked example. The private source collection is excluded. Tests establish implemented checks rather than mathematical truth, scholarly review or rights clearance."
